revious player win this trick. Then I can respond to their lead next turn. Since the previous player has 2 cards, they might not be able to finish in one go, giving me a final chance to play out.\n\nGiven the card counting and the fact that I have no bombs or strong combos to end the game now, passing is strategically better to avoid giving the initiative directly to the single-card opponent.\n\n**Answer:**  \n{"cards": []}'}
